  42:../src/Focus_States/Coarse_Focus_State.c **** /**
  43:../src/Focus_States/Coarse_Focus_State.c ****  * @fn State_t Focus_State(Context_t*, Event_t*)
  44:../src/Focus_States/Coarse_Focus_State.c ****  * @brief Implements movements of the focus mechanism
  45:../src/Focus_States/Coarse_Focus_State.c ****  * On entry, the PI controller and path planner are initialized with an indicated
  46:../src/Focus_States/Coarse_Focus_State.c ****  * final position. Time stepping (10 msec) is implemented with software timer. The path
  47:../src/Focus_States/Coarse_Focus_State.c ****  * planner provdes for acceleration and deccelleration. The update continues until the
  48:../src/Focus_States/Coarse_Focus_State.c ****  * position is within a deadband of the final position. On entry a fault timer is started. If
  49:../src/Focus_States/Coarse_Focus_State.c ****  * the final position is not reached within a timeout, it indicates that the mechanism is stuck.
  50:../src/Focus_States/Coarse_Focus_State.c ****  * When the movement is done, the state machine transitions back to idle if there are no faults
  51:../src/Focus_States/Coarse_Focus_State.c ****  * or to a fault state if the fault timeout occurs.
  52:../src/Focus_States/Coarse_Focus_State.c ****  *
  53:../src/Focus_States/Coarse_Focus_State.c ****  * @param context Focus state context
  54:../src/Focus_States/Coarse_Focus_State.c ****  * @param event
  55:../src/Focus_States/Coarse_Focus_State.c ****  * @return Next state.
  56:../src/Focus_States/Coarse_Focus_State.c ****  */
